Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.98,0:23:37.94,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}やり過ごせないもの
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.94,0:23:40.98,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}生きてかなくちゃ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.98,0:23:45.66,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}明日が待ち迎えてる
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.66,0:23:51.24,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果てしなくて　儚いね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.24,0:23:57.42,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心なんて　どこにも　ないと思えばいい
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.67,0:24:00.67,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}まぶしくて
