Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.16,0:23:14.21,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}在另一侧 今天仍有人
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.33,0:23:20.17,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}日渐颓败 却仍然站立
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.34,0:23:26.05,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}刺痛胸口的这份寂寞
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.22,0:23:31.93,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}点或是线 断断续续
Dialogue: 2,0:23:31.93,0:23:34.98,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}面具碎裂
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.98,0:23:37.94,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}那无法回避的一切
Dialogue: 2,0:23:37.94,0:23:40.98,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}不得不活下去
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.98,0:23:45.66,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}明天已经在等待
Dialogue: 2,0:23:45.66,0:23:51.24,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}无边无际 却又如此短暂
Dialogue: 2,0:23:51.24,0:23:57.42,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}就当作心这种东西 根本不存在吧
Dialogue: 2,0:23:57.67,0:24:00.67,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}耀眼得难以直视
Dialogue: 2,0:24:00.67,0:24:04.72,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}柔软的手心
Dialogue: 2,0:24:04.72,0:24:13.02,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}那一天 我回握了那只手
